    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "Factorise $x^4+4y^4$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x^2+2y^2-2xy)(x^2+2y^2+2xy)$.\n\nComplete a square, then factorise the difference of two squares.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^4+4y^4&=(x^2+2y^2)^2-4x^2y^2\\\\x^4+4y^4&=(x^2+2y^2)^2-(2xy)^2\\\\x^4+4y^4&=(x^2+2y^2-2xy)(x^2+2y^2+2xy).\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 29
  },
